OL,3,GNEWSABook swap scheme aims to inspire
OL,4,Ayoung readers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Jersey charity has created a book
OL,7,Fexchange box as part of a bid to
OL,8,Fencourage children to take up reading.
OL,10,FEvery Child Our Future said the scheme
OL,11,Fwould operate in a take-a-book,
OL,12,Fleave-a-book style system.
OL,14,FIt said by sharing books in this way,
OL,15,Fstories that had been loved by one
OL,16,Fchild could find a new home with
OL,17,Fanother, giving more children the
OL,18,Fchance to discover the pleasure of
OL,19,Freading.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
