OL,3,GNEWSABook swap scheme aims to inspire
OL,4,Ayoung readers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity's chief executive Cris
OL,7,FLakeman said she wanted to "make
OL,8,Freading accessible and something that
OL,9,Fchildren feel excited about".
